BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 446.173 Td (4. Fuse interfacing to the neck facings.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.50 Tf 0.0667 0.0667 0.0667 rg 56.693 423.496 Td (5. Staystitch the neckline just inside the seam line so it doesn't stretch while you work.) Tj ET
